{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not recreate a parent completed in an earlier invocation.** `endedOperationIds` is reset per invocation, so a callback or invoke completed after its direct context finished passes this check and is parented to that context\u2019s deterministic span ID, despite ending later. Consult operation history and timestamps, falling back to `Workflow` when a completion follows a terminal direct parent, and add a cross-invocation regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs79-_go","finding_digest":"c4e807746abf7c339d92c69579449ce4a8d2dc101028b9a7d9a74c854725d94b","finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::resolveoperationparentcontext::ended-parent-containment","line":719,"observation_digest":"00840e32b0258029f70ee940a0ef5a915fc047572dbbe0c73e590f16dfad9d51","observation_id":"aro_v1_acca4mvqewact5yo5fakb322sf","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ytuao5dkx56dhhmsy2kxsre44s","published_at":"2026-10-13T16:16:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_r4olcymuiwaynliijlcznb66bt","reviewed_base_sha":"571858c7fe344824427303b51f4f673fe7467c91","reviewed_head_sha":"4122a53701e0506e4d4d3203877eff60bb2e66e5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":719,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_ifgvqtrtpqhrijcj7y5kfmby6t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T16:16:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
